msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/outgoing/localization.rst:184
msgid ""
"You can use the :php:func:`lang()` helper function to retrieve text from "
"any of the language files, by passing the filename and the language key "
"as the first parameter, separated by a period (``.``)."
msgstr ""

